      "source_type": "ORIGINAL_STAR_OR_COMBINATION_TEXT_LINE",
      "exact_original_Chinese_Wikitext_quote": "廉贞在申寅宫闹中生财，陷宫先难后易，贪狼生横发横破，见羊火极生横进之财，",
