      "source_type": "ORIGINAL_STAR_OR_COMBINATION_TEXT_LINE",
      "exact_original_Chinese_Wikitext_quote": "天府富足，见羊陀火铃空劫有成败，紫微同巨积，廉贞武曲同加权禄为富奢翁。",
